portchester_downtown.json: OpenStreetMap ways (highway=*) in about one square kilometre of downtown Port Chester, NY,
clipped on 2026-11-09 from an Overpass API answer (the query in sizeup/roadgraph.py), with only the tags the road graph
reads. Used by tests/test_rig_routes.py (GitHub #360).

portchester_south_end.json: the drivable OpenStreetMap ways (the road graph's classes and service filter) within about
450 m of the South End firehouse, clipped on 2026-11-12 from an Overpass API answer, with only the tags the road graph
reads. Used by tests/test_firehouse_gates.py (the firehouse's bay-door egress).

ryebrook_firehouse.json: the same, within about 450 m of the Rye Brook firehouse (940 King St), clipped on 2026-11-12.
Used by tests/test_firehouse_gates.py (out onto King St, back in through the lot behind it).

